		{
			"id": "e8U2XQFSwrIZq5IMt",
			"description": "Lasgun, Accatran Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Sealed-housing pattern associated with the Death Korps of Krieg, built for trench warfare, gas attack and sustained exposure to mud and ash — a design emphasis that recurs throughout Krieg background art and Forge World material.\n\nDesign: Damage fixed at the lasgun anchor (7d(2) burn); the sealed barrel shroud that keeps mud and gas out marginally shortens the beam path, modelled as a small range reduction (380/1140 vs. the Kantrael's 400/1200) rather than any change to the fixed damage figure. Handling: min ST corrected to 9, matching the Kantrael's corrected figure (√(10×8.5)≈9.2) - the sealed shroud changes range, not the rifle's actual mass enough to move the rounded ST. RoF, Bulk and Rcl are unchanged.",
